{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28483","headline":"寄内兄和州崔员外十二韵 · 杜牧","name":"寄内兄和州崔员外十二韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"历阳崔太守，何日不含情。\n恩义同锺李，埙篪实弟兄。\n光尘能混合，擘画最分明。\n台阁仁贤誉，闺门孝友声。\n西方像教毁，南海绣衣行。\n金橐宁回顾，珠簟肯一枨。\n秪宜裁密诏，何自取专城。\n进退无非道，徊翔必有名。\n好风初婉软，离思苦萦盈。\n金马旧游贵，桐庐春水生。\n雨侵寒牖梦，梅引冻醪倾。\n共祝中兴主，高歌唱太平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28483.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28483","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}